{
  "uid": "quickdrop-overview",
  "title": "QuickDrop \u2014 Overview",
  "description": "Is the product working? Orders, correctness, latency, errors.",
  "tags": [
    "quickdrop"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "annotations": {
    "list": [
      {
        "builtIn": 1,
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "hide": true,
        "iconColor": "rgba(0, 211, 255, 1)",
        "name": "Annotations & Alerts",
        "type": "dashboard"
      },
      {
        "datasource": {
          "type": "grafana",
          "uid": "-- Grafana --"
        },
        "enable": true,
        "iconColor": "orange",
        "name": "Toggle changes",
        "target": {
          "type": "tags",
          "tags": [
            "toggle"
          ],
          "matchAny": true,
          "limit": 200
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "QuickDrop dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "quickdrop"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Business first, machines second.** Top rows: is the product working (orders, correctness, latency)? Lower rows: what the load generator is doing. Drill into *Service saturation*, *Postgres* and *Containers* from the dashboard links (top right) to find **why**.\n\nOrange vertical lines are **toggle changes** \u2014 the moment someone flipped a strategy."
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "id": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Correctness \u2014 every number here must be 0",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Invariant violations",
      "description": "Business rules checked every 5 s by SQL (see InvariantChecker.java). Anything above 0 means the data is wrong: oversold stock, a rider on two orders at once, duplicate orders. Only data since the last fixtures reset is checked.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (invariant) (quickdrop_invariant_violations)",
          "legendFormat": "{{invariant}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "id": 3
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Orders",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 1
      },
      "id": 4
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Orders per second by result",
      "description": "Every order attempt and how it ended. placed = got a rider; placed_pending_rider = no rider free yet; replayed = duplicate request answered from the idempotency table; anything else is an exception class.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(quickdrop_orders_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 30,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 5
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Order placement latency",
      "description": "Time spent inside OrderService.placeOrder. The gap between p50 and p99 is where the pain hides: averages look fine while 1 in 100 customers waits seconds (scenario 0.2).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(quickdrop_order_placement_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(quickdrop_order_placement_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(quickdrop_order_placement_seconds_bucket[1m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99",
          "refId": "C"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(quickdrop_order_placement_seconds_sum[1m])) / sum(rate(quickdrop_order_placement_seconds_count[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "average",
          "refId": "D"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": true,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull",
            "max"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "id": 6
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
